Dear Daniel,

L is an internal list that is made in summary.pairwise.  The error results because the function to make this list probably did not work, so the error message is illogical.

I discovered that the reason for the error is there is no option (currently) for standardizing the slope vector lengths.  This is an oversight because the update worked with differences between mean vectors, as intended, but I forgot that one can also find the distance between slope vectors.  (Normally, one would find the angular difference between slope vectors, but it does not mean it is not possible to find the distance.

I’ll try to update this soon.  Please be patient because this might require some mathematical development, not just some tweaking of code.

Mike

